From: Brady <brady@aioscilloscope.com>
Subject: regulator: rk808: bind the RK808's own regulator cell (6.12)
Copyright (C) 2026 Olympian LED, Inc.

The RK808 MFD registers an "rk808-regulator" cell, but the regulator
driver's platform id table did not list it, so on an RK808 board the cell
was never bound and none of the PMIC's regulators registered. Add the
missing id.

---
diff --git a/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c b/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
--- a/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
@@ -1776,6 +1776,7 @@
 
 static const struct platform_device_id rk8xx_regulator_id_table[] = {
 	{ "rk805-regulator", 0 },
+	{ "rk808-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk809-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-regulator", 0 },
